{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/iIWciu5fiLSyUQHYzr6KMpLYKu2.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"https://seventh-art.com/product/caravaggio/","id":1496903,"imdb_id":"tt38351366","origin_country":["GB"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Caravaggio","overview":"Five years in production, this is the most extensive film ever made about one of the greatest artists of all time – Caravaggio. Featuring masterpiece after masterpiece and with first-hand testimony from the artist himself on the eve of his mysterious disappearance, this beautiful new film reveals Caravaggio as never before. Multi-award-winning filmmakers David Bickerstaff and Phil Grabsky delve into the hidden narratives of Caravaggio’s life, piecing together clues embedded within his incredible art. The intriguing self-depictions within his works — sometimes disguised, sometimes in plain sight — offer a rare window into his psyche and personal struggles. Join us as we unravel the story of one of history’s most brilliant, complex and controversial figures.","popularity":0.9598,"poster_path":"/dRfDBbdVFsiRAKC5dhKcsIlPJI5.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":45654,"logo_path":null,"name":"Seventh Art Productions","origin_country":"GB"}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"GB","name":"United Kingdom"}],"release_date":"2025-11-11","revenue":0,"runtime":101,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"English","iso_639_1":"en","name":"English"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Caravaggio","video":false,"vote_average":9.25,"vote_count":4,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[{"iso_3166_1":"GB","title":"Caravaggio","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"ES","title":"Caravaggio","type":""}]}}